# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the image needs. Secrets
# (.env*, config.local.toml), PRD*, .superpowers, .venv, .git, tests and
# deploy/.remote.local can never reach the image, because nothing is sent
# unless it is named below.
*
!requirements.txt
!discord_mcp/
!deploy/entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
